 CBAutoConfWin args;sz;id;h;w;incr;pos;maxtop
⍝ Callbacks for DemoAutoConfWin. Uses globals set by the demo: TOTAL (rows in the
⍝ virtual dataset), top (0-based offset of the first visible row), vis/cols (the
⍝ window size that currently fits). Three jobs, keyed by object id:
⍝   button  -> toggle the form size (a browser-mode way to resize the form)
⍝   grid    -> Configure: recompute how many rows/cols fit, redeploy, size the bar
⍝   scroll  -> Scroll: move the visible window through the dataset (re-slice)
 id←⊃args

 :If id≡'F1.BAR.BTN'
     sz←'F1' eWG 'Size'
     :If 460=1⊃sz
         'F1' eWS 'Size' (900 1320)
     :Else
         'F1' eWS 'Size' (460 700)
     :EndIf

 :ElseIf id≡'F1.APP.GRID'   ⍝ Configure Info = [top left height width]
     h←5⊃args ⋄ w←6⊃args
     vis←3⌈⌊(h-24)÷16       ⍝ rows that fit (minus the title band, over the pitch)
     cols←2⌈⌊(w-4)÷90       ⍝ columns that fit
     maxtop←0⌈TOTAL-vis
     top←maxtop⌊top
     'F1.APP.GRID' eWS ('Values'((⍕¨top+⍳vis)∘.,'/',¨⍕¨⍳cols))('RowTitles'(⍕¨top+⍳vis))
     ⍝ Bar stretches vertically via its Attach (like GAMA's Y2 — no ⎕WS Size).
     ⍝ Only Range/Thumb change, to reflect the visible window vs the dataset.
     'F1.APP.VS' eWS ('Range' TOTAL)('Thumb' vis)

 :ElseIf id≡'F1.APP.VS'     ⍝ Scroll Info = [increment position]
     incr←3⊃args ⋄ pos←4⊃args
     maxtop←0⌈TOTAL-vis
     :If incr∊1 ¯1          ⍝ line up / line down
         top←0⌈maxtop⌊top+incr
     :Else                  ⍝ thumb drag / page: position is 1-based
         top←0⌈maxtop⌊pos-1
     :EndIf
     'F1.APP.GRID' eWS ('Values'((⍕¨top+⍳vis)∘.,'/',¨⍕¨⍳cols))('RowTitles'(⍕¨top+⍳vis))
 :EndIf
